            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kilenji Jehovah Musa, Ameiywei inendet: amu kande inendet eung’ung’ koboto bikyik tugul, ak emennyi; ak iyachini inendet ko u ye kiiyachi Sihon laitoriatab Amorik, ne kimenyei Hesbon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kibar anyun inendet, koboto werikyik, ak bikyik tugul, kot ko ma ng’etyi inendet agot agenge: ak kibunji ichek emennyi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.35",
